# Content board

Read `.cursor/skills/content-board/SKILL.md` before a content pass.

- `ops/board/` is the status. One file per place. Claim that place before editing, and update it before you finish.
- One worker takes one place and one stage. Other places may run at the same time.
- Do not edit page templates, layout, styles, or `src/lib/partners.ts` in a content run.
- Do not set pause or `holdPlaces`. The owner does that.
